  "version": 1,
  "concept": "A · Precision Lab",
  "purpose": "A precise, quiet desktop instrument face for inspecting three asynchronously updated distance channels through one Pico USB connection.",
  "tone": "Light, neutral, calm and technical. Restrained vermilion identifies TFmini and demo state.",
  "differentiation": "One dominant laser instrument plus two compact horizontal channel rows; a broad 30-second graph occupies the larger right field. No equal-sized sensor cards.",
