  "notes": [
    "All values and chart traces are explicitly demo data.",
    "Connection label: 演示连接 · Pico USB. This is a design preview with no hardware access.",
    "TFmini raw unit is mm; cm/mm selector applies only to TFmini. All distance readouts remain cm.",
    "TFmini 32 ms, ultrasonic channels 124 ms updates are independent. Upper timeout leaves a chart gap.",
    "解析间隔 is 8.2 ms; it is not a claim about true sampling.",
